{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c7e9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0addc-f5a7-7d72-82bc-9d078a927129"},"sequence":591,"recorded_at":1780531400001177,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"05ccea39-0df0-456b-a475-42ee00a3a1b7","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"05ccea39-0df0-456b-a475-42ee00a3a1b7","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"05ccea39-0df0-456b-a475-42ee00a3a1b7"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0adde-61f5-70f0-949a-e8df853a82bc"},"task_id":"01a0adde-61f5-70f0-949a-e8df853a82bc","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0adde-61f5-70f0-949a-e8df853a82bc","chunk":"Read text file `internal/hosttrust/transact.go`.\n1|package hosttrust\n2|\n3|import (\n4|\t\"errors\"\n5|\t\"os\"\n6|\t\"path/filepath\"\n7|\n8|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/localstore\"\n9|)\n10|\n11|// Snapshot is one coherent committed read: trust bytes plus the generation\n12|// that authorized them. Streams and dispatches bind this generation; any use\n13|// must re-check currency before crossing a side-effect boundary.\n14|type Snapshot struct {\n15|\tGeneration uint64\n16|\tTrust      TrustStore\n17|}\n18|\n19|// TransactionFunc mutates a copy of the committed trust. Returning nil\n20|// commits with generation+1; returning an error aborts with no durable effect.\n21|type TransactionFunc func(trust *TrustStore) error\n22|\n23|// ReadSnapshot obtains one coherent committed snapshot under a shared lock.\n24|// A missing store is ErrTrustStoreMissing, never an empty store. Unreadable,\n25|// malformed or partially read state refuses; leftover staging files from\n26|// crashed commits are ignored and never selected.\n27|func (store *Store) ReadSnapshot() (Snapshot, error) {\n28|\treturn readSnapshot(store.fs, store.root, store.lock, store.paths)\n29|}\n30|\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
