nchanged, no new clause discharge claimed) with reviewed digest 5102d3bce23e6f27264232332a300dbb89237dc7792673efe9ec039b1219ce08; README figures pin green.\n+- AC: 7 of 7 RPC rows driven through Serve/Dial/Call by named tests (see hostchannel README table). Stated bounds: no ax CLI/SSH launch/provider plugin (computed Config-4 argv only), SSH-carrier parity by construction (no SSH-impl branch), async one-second close via WatchGeneration polling, TLS alert text owned by crypto/tls. Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree; no review acceptance or main integration claimed.\n+\n+## 2026-09-17\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"LOGBOOK.md","added":18,"removed":6},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
