fore server flight validation (test-harness rendezvous deadlock), Go alert errors implement `net.Error` (classifier keys on `Op==\"remote error\"`), a `%w: %v` chain-drop bug class fixed across 37 sites, and Go's 256 KiB handshake cap firing before the specified 1 MiB cap (unit-proven + integration-bounded). Stated bounds: no `ax` CLI/SSH launch/provider plugin, SSH parity by construction, async close via `WatchGeneration` polling, no new clause discharge claimed.","reason":null}}
